   284	// TestSettleBreakerDeadLettersThroughAStall is the ENT-1535 remedy, and the
   285	// regression test for the filtered-consumer defect: the message sits at a
   286	// stream sequence far above the ack floor, exactly as a poison event does when
   287	// non-matching subjects sit between it and the floor. An identification rule
   288	// keyed on floor+1 misses it (measured against a live server: floor 2, blocker
   289	// at stream 6); the conjunction does not.
