   169	  delivery and goes stale the moment it is redelivered. Instead the breaker
   170	  requires three independently-true facts — the consumer is stalled, this
   171	  message is above the ack floor, and this message has itself been failing at
   172	  least `FloorAge` (from its own delivery count against the ladder). Gap-proof,
