   152	  It triggers on **floor-stall age**, not message stream-age: the two diverge
   153	  badly under backlog, where 35 minutes of receipt→first-delivery lag on a
   154	  perfectly healthy message would read as a stall. Stalled is also not the
   155	  same as *stationary* — the clock runs only while the consumer has delivered
   156	  past its own floor, so an idle consumer's motionless floor never accrues
