   525	// entiredb is down for an hour. Every message in flight fails, the floor is
   526	// stalled, and every one of them satisfies the breaker's conditions: above
   527	// the floor, failing longer than the threshold, past MinDeliveries. Left
   528	// unrationed the breaker would empty the consumer into the DLQ — which is
